@startuml app_shell_module_diagram
title Frontend - App shell and routing module

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members

package "Entry" {
  class main.jsx
  class App
}

package "Shell components" {
  class SiteHeader
  class AuthDialog
  class VisualizationModal
}

package "Pages" {
  class HomePage
  class PatternPage
  class PatternQuizPage
  class QuizDashboardPage
  class NotFoundPage
}

package "Hooks" {
  class usePlaygroundApp <<hook>>
}

package "Utils" {
  class playgroundUtils <<utils>>
  class playgroundConstants <<constants>>
}

package "Data sources" {
  class api <<http client>>
  class fallbackPatterns
  class patternLearningContent
  class patternUmlDiagrams
}

main.jsx --> App
App --> usePlaygroundApp
App --> SiteHeader
App --> AuthDialog
App --> VisualizationModal

App --> HomePage
App --> PatternPage
App --> PatternQuizPage
App --> QuizDashboardPage
App --> NotFoundPage

usePlaygroundApp --> api
usePlaygroundApp --> playgroundUtils
usePlaygroundApp --> playgroundConstants
usePlaygroundApp --> fallbackPatterns
usePlaygroundApp --> patternLearningContent
usePlaygroundApp --> patternUmlDiagrams

playgroundUtils ..> fallbackPatterns

note bottom of App
Le composant App reste leger :
il selectionne la page a afficher
selon la route normalisee et transmet
les callbacks issus de usePlaygroundApp.
end note

note bottom of playgroundUtils
Le routing est gere sans react-router.
La navigation repose sur :
- parseRoute()
- history.pushState()
- popstate listener
end note

@enduml
